OL,3,GNEWSAMP 'deeply concerned' by BAE plan
OL,4,Ato cut 1,000 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said he is "deeply concerned"
OL,7,Fover plans by Britain's largest defence
OL,8,Fcontractor, BAE Systems, to cut about
OL,9,F1,000 members of staff.
OL,11,FBAE said it planned to cut up to 1,070
OL,12,Fstaff members from its head office and
OL,13,Fair sector, across its sites in Warton
OL,14,Fand Samlesbury in Lancashire, Frimley
OL,15,Fin Surrey and London, to ensure the
OL,16,Ffirm remained "efficient, agile and
OL,17,Faffordable".
OL,19,FAndrew Snowden, Conservative MP for
OL,20,FFylde, said he was concerned by the
OL,21,Fnews and he would continue to press the
OL,22,Fgovernment to "back British defence".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
